{"3151140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shelf Heroes", "steam_appid": 3151140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shelf Heroes</strong> is a Roguelite FPS where where your limbs are the loot. Lose an arm mid-fight, grab a better one, keep shooting. Build wild perk combos from modular pieces and blast enemies to plastic bits. Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIELD WACKY WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAPOW! Blast rebellious toys with an arsenal that would make any toy box jealous! A <strong>DIY shotgun</strong>? Locked and Loaded! A <strong>dinosaur-shaped revolver</strong>? You got it! A <strong>frying pan, explosive bow, or a blaster minigun</strong>… and MORE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE GIANT HOUSE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own route through <strong>massive open arenas</strong> of the House! Every run brings <strong>new layouts, new challenges, and new secrets</strong> to discover. Watch out for household hazards - that kiddie pool becomes an ocean when you're toy-sized! Return to your Bedroom HQ to unlock upgrades, chat with sock puppet pals, and prep for the next battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWAP PARTS TO FIT YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each body part—arm, leg, head, and torso—adds <strong>unique perks</strong> to customize your playstyle every run. Combine perks with random power-ups to <strong>discover wild builds</strong> and turn your toy-sized warrior into an unstoppable force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE TOY TERRORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against rampaging toy Sentinels, Zep Knights, Sharkars, the dreaded dino Ravager, and many other deadly toy threats! Push your skills to the limit: dodge, blast, outmaneuver enemies and take down the toughest bosses to take back the House!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shelf Heroes</strong> is a Roguelite FPS where where your limbs are the loot. Lose an arm mid-fight, grab a better one, keep shooting. Build wild perk combos from modular pieces and blast enemies to plastic bits. Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WIELD WACKY WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAPOW! Blast rebellious toys with an arsenal that would make any toy box jealous! A <strong>DIY shotgun</strong>? Locked and Loaded! A <strong>dinosaur-shaped revolver</strong>? You got it! A <strong>frying pan, explosive bow, or a blaster minigun</strong>… and MORE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE GIANT HOUSE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/0508e95b63eedde5221c8403c19dca8e.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own route through <strong>massive open arenas</strong> of the House! Every run brings <strong>new layouts, new challenges, and new secrets</strong> to discover. Watch out for household hazards - that kiddie pool becomes an ocean when you're toy-sized! Return to your Bedroom HQ to unlock upgrades, chat with sock puppet pals, and prep for the next battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWAP PARTS TO FIT YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/12cbbc2f6090429ec8f3843fe722462c.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each body part—arm, leg, head, and torso—adds <strong>unique perks</strong> to customize your playstyle every run. Combine perks with random power-ups to <strong>discover wild builds</strong> and turn your toy-sized warrior into an unstoppable force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE TOY TERRORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.poster.avif?t=1775057143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.webm?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.mp4?t=1775057143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against rampaging toy Sentinels, Zep Knights, Sharkars, the dreaded dino Ravager, and many other deadly toy threats! Push your skills to the limit: dodge, blast, outmaneuver enemies and take down the toughest bosses to take back the House!</p>", "short_description": "Blast rogue toys with wacky weapons in this fast-paced Roguelite FPS! Mix &amp; match toy parts to assemble your Shelf Hero, discover powerful perk combos, and explore a giant House. Play solo or with friends in 3-player co-op!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam